Trimmed real data (ruling T1). fonts.json holds 13 of the 72 entries of Nerd
Fonts' bin/scripts/lib/fonts.json at commit
64a084f95480ee5efb62132c01cd142ab6147655 (2026-09-01), unchanged apart from the
entries left out:
https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts/blob/64a084f95480ee5efb62132c01cd142ab6147655/bin/scripts/lib/fonts.json

pin.json names that commit, as the nerdfonts collector records it. expected.csv
is the miner's output for these two files (tests/aliases/nerd/test_nerd.py).

